  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-slategray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Time Theft</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Will_Salas_and_Sylvia_Weis.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171016130317\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Will Salas and Sylvia Weis\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Will_Salas_and_Sylvia_Weis.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20171016130317\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Will_Salas_and_Sylvia_Weis.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20171016130317 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/65/Will_Salas_and_Sylvia_Weis.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20171016130317 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Will Salas and Sylvia Weis\" width=\"270\" height=\"290\" data-image-key=\"Will_Salas_and_Sylvia_Weis.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Will Salas and Sylvia Weis.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Will Salas and Sylvia Weis (In Time) can steal, transfer their age, time to other humans when in body contact or vice versa. It is displayed on a clock implanted on people's arms like what is shown on this image.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal time.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"For a few to be immortal, many must die.\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Henry Hamilton (In Time)</dd></dl></div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"All the time [people] save, they lose to us. We drain it off, we hoard it, we thirst for it. Human beings have no conception of the value of their time, but we do. We suck them dry, and we need more and more time every day, because there are more and more of us. More and more and more. . .\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― A member  of the Grey Gentlemen to Momo (Momo)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>steal time from others</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Time_Manipulation\" title=\"Time Manipulation\">Time Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Powers\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Powers</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Cartoons\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cartoons</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Literature\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Literature</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Live_Television/Movies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Live Television/Movies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Life Stealing</li>\n<li>Life-Span Stealing</li>\n<li>Time Stealing</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User is able to steal time from other beings or objects and gain variety of advantages from the process.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Age_Transferal\" title=\"Age Transferal\">Age Transferal</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Life-Force_Absorption\" title=\"Life-Force Absorption\">Life-Force Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Temporal_Healing\" title=\"Temporal Healing\">Temporal Healing</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Age_Acceleration\" title=\"Age Acceleration\">Age Acceleration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Sense\" title=\"Death Sense\">Death Sense</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Delayed_Immortality\" title=\"Delayed Immortality\">Delayed Immortality</a> - As user ages at a normal rate and eventually becomes immortal upon reaching maturity, they must steal time from others in order to live longer and therefore maintain their immortality.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superior_Human_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Superior Human Physiology\">Superior Human Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Time_Reduction\" title=\"Time Reduction\">Time Reduction</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Time_Speeding\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Time Speeding\">Time Speeding</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May have limited range, including touch only.</li>\n<li>May be limited to only objects or organisms.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Julius_Novachrono\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Julius Novachrono\">Julius Novachrono</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li>Falana (<i>Children of the Whales</i>)</li>\n<li>Weeping Angels (<i>Doctor Who</i>)</li>\n<li>Shinigami (<i>Death Note</i>)</li>\n<li>Humans (<i>In Time</i>)</li>\n<li>Chrono (<i>Chrono Crusade</i>); via the pocket watch</li>\n<li>Kurumi Tokisaki (<i>Date A live</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Charlotte_Linlin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Charlotte Linlin\">Charlotte \"Big Mom\" Linlin</a> (<i>One Piece</i>); via the <a href=\"https://onepiece.fandom.com/wiki/Soru_Soru_no_Mi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:onepiece:Soru Soru no Mi\">Soru Soru no Mi</a></li>\n<li>Phane (<i>Planescape</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://typemoon.fandom.com/wiki/Aoko_Aozaki\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:typemoon:Aoko Aozaki\">Aoko Aozaki</a> (<i>TYPE-MOON</i>)</li>\n<li>Ultear (<i>Fairy Tail</i>); via Last Ages</li>\n<li>Alix Kubdel/Timebreaker (<i>Miraculous: Tales of Ladybug &amp; Cat Noir</i>)</li>\n<li>Rikku (<i>Final Fantasy X-2</i>); via the Thief Dressphere</li>\n<li>Yuna (<i>Final Fantasy X-2</i>); via the Thief Dressphere</li>\n<li>Paine (<i>Final Fantasy X-2</i>); via the Thief Dressphere</li>\n<li>The Men in Grey/The Grey Gentlemen/Time Thieves (<i>Momo</i>)</li>\n<li>Clockmon (<i>Digimon Ghost Game</i>)</li>\n<li>Papa Justify (<i>The Skeleton Key</i>)</li>\n<li>Mama Cecile (<i>The Skeleton Key</i>)</li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Powers\">Known Powers</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Chronophage (<i>Edens Zero</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FAeni.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Aeni/Manhwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTime_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D9&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"b326bd6cee5b76cd62ffaf700a28e30e\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:121px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Date-A-Live-II-Episode-8_41625-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:109px; width:195px; top:5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Date-A-Live-II-Episode-8_41625.jpg\" title=\"Date-A-Live-II-Episode-8 41625.jpg (34 KB)\" style=\"height:109px; width:195px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f1/Date-A-Live-II-Episode-8_41625.jpg/revision/latest/s